# Too little memory (roadmap memory.md M2, D4; disk-scheduler.md M8b): the
# least machine is 639 KB of base memory and 384 KB of extended memory, the
# owner's (2026-11-09). With less of either - 320 KB or 640 KB without
# extended memory, 512 KB with 1 MB of it - the kernel says so and stops,
# where it once handed out what was not there or left the root unable to
# build (memory.md E3).
memory: 320K 0K
memory: 639K 0K
memory: 640K 0K
memory: 512K 1M
---
rx286, test build
rx286 PANIC: too little memory: rx286 needs 639 KB below 1 MB and 384 KB above
